<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="fa" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><title>Register — DoNext</title></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-white"><main class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center p-6"><div class="w-full max-w-md"><a href="{{url('/dashboard')}}" class="text-2xl font-black">DoNext</a><div class="mt-10"><h1 class="text-3xl font-black">ساخت حساب</h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">در چند ثانیه فضای کاری خودت را بساز.</p></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-4"><label class="block text-sm font-bold">نام<input class="mt-2 h-12 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900" placeholder="Reza"></label><label class="block text-sm font-bold">ایمیل<input type="email" class="mt-2 h-12 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900" placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label class="block text-sm font-bold">رمز عبور<input type="password" class="mt-2 h-12 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900" placeholder="••••••••"></label><label class="block text-sm font-bold">تکرار رمز عبور<input type="password" class="mt-2 h-12 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900" placeholder="••••••••"></label><button class="w-full rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-indigo-700">ساخت حساب</button></div><p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-400">قبلاً حساب ساخته‌ای؟ <a href="{{url('/login')}}" class="font-bold text-indigo-600">ورود</a></p></div></main></body></html>